"""
Test suite for the hierarchical RAG retrieval substrate.

Covers:
  1. Section splitting metadata — all required keys present and correctly formed.
  2. Chunk metadata propagation — parent_<extra_key> present on chunks when
     extra_meta_keys lists that key.
  3. Filter fallback behavior — retrieve_with_ids falls back gracefully from
     (doc+section) to (doc only) to unfiltered.
  4. RRF fusion — deduplication, top_k truncation, boost for shared documents.
  5. Corpus idempotency — load_or_build returns cache on second call without
     re-invoking the embeddings model.
  6. Chroma namespace isolation — two CorpusConfigs produce distinct chroma_dir paths.
  7. _eval_filter — Chroma-style filter predicate correctness.

Usage:
    pytest tests/test_retrieval.py -v

TODO(rename): adjust the import paths to match your project layout.
"""
